course: dictionary
lesson: 5706
title: Lone
level: primary-4
stars: 1
explain: Lone means alone, the only one there, with no others. Look at the words around it to check. «Standing under a lone tree in a thunderstorm is dangerous.» One tree, standing by itself, is what the sentence describes.
explain: Lone can also mean one single thing. In maths, a lone bird joined by 5 makes 6, so lone counts the 1 that is easy to miss. In stories, lone paints a quiet or lonely picture, like a lone rider or a lone figure in the snow.
explain: To test your meaning, swap «alone» into the sentence. If it still makes sense, you have found the right meaning.
fact: Lone means alone, the only one there, with no others.
fact: «A lone wolf» is a person who likes to do things alone.
fact: The fossa, a real animal from Madagascar, is a lone hunter related to mongooses.
fact: Lightning often hits the tallest thing around, and it can jump from a lone tree to a person standing under it, so in a storm, go indoors.
fact: In maths, lone can mean the number 1, one single thing.
exercise: «A lone rider crossed the empty hills.» What does lone mean here? | Very tired | Loud and fast | *Alone, with no one else
exercise: Ava says a lone parent has help from a big crowd all day. Is she right? | *No, a lone parent brings up a child alone | Yes, lone means happy | Yes, lone means with a big crowd
exercise: In maths, «a lone bird joined by 5» makes 6. What does lone mean in that sentence? | *1 | 5 | 0 | 10
test: «Standing under a lone tree in a thunderstorm is dangerous.» Why is it dangerous? | Thunder is too loud to hear | *Lightning can jump from the tree to a person standing under it | Trees are always wet | The tree is too old to stand
test: «He is the Lord of the lone trail.» Toad is walking the trail. What does lone suggest? | Noisy and busy | Hungry and cold | With a crowd of friends | *Alone, by himself
exam: Which sentence uses lone to mean alone? | We went to the park together | Our class won the game | The kettle is loud and hot | *She was a lone figure in the snow
